# The image needs the server, the core it links, and the catalog. Everything
# else in this repository is either a build artifact or the client, and
# server/target alone is 1.1 GB of it -- sent to the daemon as build context it
# would dominate the build time of a build that does not use one byte of it.
*
!server
!sim
!catalog
server/target

# Not used by the Dockerfile and absent from a normal checkout. It exists so a
# build behind a TLS-intercepting proxy can add that proxy's CA in an extra
# layer, which needs the file inside the build context. Gitignored, so this line
# does nothing unless somebody has deliberately put one there.
!sandbox-ca.crt
